    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're leaving again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not going to try to talk me out of it this time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "When have you ever listened?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll feel empty inside if you don't at least nag a little bit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can still walk, and my limbs remain sturdy. The spring wind is still chilly, so it's not like I can sunbathe in my chair.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#16$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know how dangerous it is up north.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, Shu... You also know we have no choice...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "It took us decades just to carve out this little plot of land. But, it's still not enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're always short on food and land... If we go a bit further north, we might just find some special crops that can grow in Originium-tainted soil.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, we'd be able to cultivate the entire continent, and nobody would go hungry ever again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even more reason for you to stay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we can't find a crop like that, we'll just cultivate slowly. It might take ten generations, or a hundred, but eventually\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Does it look like I can wait that long?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, if the others heard things like 'crops that can be grown in Originium-tainted soil' or 'cultivating the entire continent,' they'd think I lost my mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no arguing with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wisdom is one of the perks that comes with age.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "The woman extends her hand, her fingers tightly clenched."
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, Shu... Would you mind reading my palm again? See if this old lady still has the luck to realize her dreams this late in life?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I already told you, I'm not doing that anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "The woman smiles and unclasps her hand, revealing a small white flower in the middle of her palm. She pins the flower to the hair bun of the girl in front of her."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1242_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I found this in the fields today. I do believe it's the first flower to bloom this year, and that's surely a good omen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe I'll make it back in time for this year's harvest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "text": "You just keep track of the days, and have some short-rib soup ready for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
