        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Tianshi...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Farmer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shu?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#18$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been loitering around here all morning. You don't wanna give up on this piece of land, do you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The mountains are lush, the water is clear, and the food's good too... I like it here a lot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tianshi Shu, you were transferred to Dahuang not too long ago, right? You look very young.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Farmer"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been here since I was born. Sixty-seven now... In all my years, I never thought I'd see the day when I had to leave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Farmer"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's said that more than a thousand years have passed since Shennong reclaimed this land. How could we just...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just as crops are planted in spring and harvested in autumn, one cannot hope to evade the elements forever. It is the way of the world for things to go wrong, and we can only let nature run its course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "text": "When you move to a nomadic city, everyone will have something to do. Trust that the proper arrangements have been made.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "We just don't understand... We thought our harvest has been weak the past two years because of the weather. It's nothing we can't overcome with a bit of hard work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Farmer"
    },
    {
        "text": "But now, you're telling us there's something wrong with the land itself... Shu, you Tianshis are wiser than us. Can't you please think of a way to save this land?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Farmer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just tell us what we have to do. It doesn't matter how hard we have to work, even if it means tilling every last clump of soil\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_2025_shu_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "It rained just two days ago, so how come this land is...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tired Farmer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_dkmgcvlspd"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "47_g1_desertedcityfield_d",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 4
    },
    {
        "tag": "backgroundtween",
        "xScaleFrom": 1.05,
        "yScaleFrom": 1.05,
        "xScaleTo": 1,
        "yScaleTo": 1,
        "duration": 3.5,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "fadetime": 3,
        "keep": true,
        "initamount": 0,
        "amount": 1,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The farmer standing at the edge of the field suddenly goes wide-eyed."
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_surfacefrozen"
    },
    {
        "text": "All the water stored in the fields drains away at a speed discernable to the naked eye, as if there is a bottomless abyss hidden beneath the land. In a flash, all the water is gone, and along with it, the life of the land."
    },
    {
        "text": "The moist paddy fields turn to hardened salt flats in an instant, countless parched fissures stretching outward."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
