    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop right there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lord Zuo.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where do you think you're going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've delivered what I needed to deliver, and seen the people I needed to see. And so, it's time for me to leave\u2014 Why, have you come to see me off, Lord Zuo?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't leave yet. Not until you've given me an explanation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "First, the Sui Regulator tells me to go, then it tells me that I have to stay... You'll have to forgive me for not being able to keep my orders straight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's your involvement with the demonic taint that's appeared in the middle of Dahuang, and what plans do you have for the devices in the core city?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's more... A hundred years ago, a particular convict escaped from the capital, and in just a few months, his pawns were all across Great Yan. What have you been doing in that time?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't fathom what you're trying to say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, I'll simply have to escort you to a place where I can make things clear to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "The fact that you came here alone shows great bravery, Lord Zuo. If not for the fact that I'm short on time, I'd be more than glad to stay and chat with such a promising young man.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... What if I choose not to play along?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The man takes out a jade weaver's shuttle. Aside from its extra-delicate appearance, nothing about it seems out of the ordinary."
    },
    {
        "text": "Zuo Le takes notice of the gossamer threads wrapped faintly around it."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop right there\u2013\u2013!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "47_g4_factory_outside",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "xScale": 1.1,
        "yScale": 1.1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_watersubcreate",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_xsplashink",
        "volume": 1,
        "delay": 0.2,
        "channel": "s"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_landscape",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "xScale": 1.05,
        "yScale": 1.05
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_landscape",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "fadeout": true,
        "xstrength": 25,
        "ystrength": 25,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_skill_skulsrsword"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.03,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "posfrom": "-150,0",
        "posto": "50,0",
        "duration": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "50,0",
        "duration": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The shock is only momentary."
    },
    {
        "text": "Before the man can lift the shuttle in his hand, the Candleholder's blade is already at his neck."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just an ordinary man. I don't have the power to fight against you proxies...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "But within this scroll, there is no difference between the two of us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "This scroll... is one of my sister's...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "How could a mortal dare to harness this power?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps you underestimated the extent to which the Feranmutologists have researched you... The Sui Regulator is fully aware of each and every one of your abilities.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never expected Dusk to have such a low opinion of me, that she'd rather team up with a Candleholder to make my life difficult...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, is it not a crime for a Candleholder to come into private contact with a proxy? As guilty as you already are, Lord Zuo, have you not considered the consequences of such an outrageous act?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The most important thing is for me to stop you right here... and bring you into custody.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "You drew the demonic taint into Dahuang in order to destroy the Twelve Pagodas and Five Cities?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was this entire incident orchestrated by that particular convict?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And if I were to say yes, what then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you going to do about it, Lord Zuo?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kill me right here and now, granting the Sui beneath the capital city even greater consciousness? Is Yan really prepared to march to war?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "If that's what it takes to stop you, then so be it. Even now, the bestial Sui may not stand as a shield for the misdeeds of your kind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nevertheless, it is still a trade whose value must be weighed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "50,0",
        "posto": "100,0",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 10,
        "vibrato": 5,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "100,0",
        "posto": "100,-30",
        "duration": 0.7,
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The man smiles, ignoring the long blade pointed at his neck. He dusts off his robe and finds a stone step to sit on."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm serious\u2013\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why so jittery? Now that I've been sealed within this painting, I am a simple tailor without the ability to so much as capture a fowlbeast. What, are you worried I'll fly away?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "We rarely get such opportunities, so let's chat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The only thing you'll be doing is answering my questions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you not at all curious about the files in the library that you don't have the authorization to access?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such a great opportunity is sitting right here. Surely, those questions are of much more interest to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't try to talk your way out of this...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, let's settle the account.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Between Great Yan, and the Feranmuts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "47_g8_crestofweir",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1238_1#2$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...The trail's gone cold?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tianshi Apprentice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1238_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If these demon-tainted seeds floated over from that river, then why do the traces of contamination get fainter the closer we go to the edge of the city...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tianshi Apprentice"
    },
    {
        "text": "Could it be...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tianshi Apprentice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "She scoops up a handful of sand and twirls it carefully within her palm, her brow knitting together."
    },
    {
        "text": "The newly-built nomadic city in the distance undulates as it sends faint vibrations through the earth, like a continuous mountain range or the bulging back of a gargantuan beast."
    },
    {
        "text": "Steel and concrete prop up soil that is thousands of years old, the massive structure seemingly erecting a bridge that spans the ages. But, who knows of the vestiges left upon this land across its myriad epochs?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1238_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was this your doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tianshi Apprentice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1238_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "All these years, you've been silently suppressing this demonic presence... What are you after?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tianshi Apprentice"
    },
    {
        "text": "How could there be any <i>Xian</i> like you...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tianshi Apprentice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_landscape",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lord Zuo, have you ever seen a silkworm? Or perhaps, heard the idiom: 'to wrap yourself in your own cocoon'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you getting at?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm quite familiar with these things.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "For these creatures to grow, they must endure a calamity. Those that survive will break out of their cocoons; those that do not will have their lives quietly snuffed out in the darkness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who are you implying is the silkworm here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You and I, and all things in existence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Say what you will, but we have no interest in comparing ourselves to insects.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You people are so proud of the civilization you've built, but are there no records of the very beginning in the Sui Regulator's files? Of how the True Lung was able to end the Hundred Clan Rebellion?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course we're aware. We understand full well that it was nothing more than a bout of folly brought about by the bestial Sui's arrogance, not a gift of any sort. Why, are you that keen for Yan to sing the praises of your kind?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, you no longer have that kind of power.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No living being can escape the cycle of destruction and rebirth. Summer insects sing not of sleet or ice. Everything we see, hear, and think is enclosed in a silken cocoon, and we must never forget our humility.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you getting at?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Since the end of that great battle and the appearance of our kind, the Sui Regulator has also accumulated a thousand years of history.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you ever considered why Yan never moved to banish the Sui, until now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "A hundred years ago, the convict incited great chaos, resulting in the death of a proxy. Now that the awakening of the bestial Sui is an inevitability, banishment has become a clear imperative.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The bestial Sui is awakening? Which Feranmutologist came up with that conclusion?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who stands to benefit when Yan goes to war? In whose interest would it be to banish the Sui?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you fail to consider these questions, Lord Zuo, or are you simply pretending that they don't exist?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why should I take anything you say at face value...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Naturally, you don't have to believe me. Let us settle another account.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "Setting aside the fact that I am a lowly peddler, my brothers and sisters have for centuries kept a great many dangers from Great Yan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even when it comes to my 'unemployed' little sister, Yan cannot even fathom the amount of effort it would've taken to build its nomadic cities without her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, there's also the sister who has been standing guard here all this time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "When it comes to the symbiotic history of the Feranmuts and Yan, from beginning to end, my brothers and sisters have done nothing to harm you. All they've wanted is to live like ordinary people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But now, they are about to lose their lives over some undeserved disaster... Tell me, Lord Zuo, how are we to settle this account?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Indeed, a number of you have made invaluable contributions to Yan, which the nation has never forgotten.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yet now, there are some of you who choose to stand against Great Yan, threatening the lives of countless people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, were you not suggesting just now that your <i>Xians</i> had taken good care of Yan? Why then, at the first sign of hardship, do you turn against the <i>Xians?</i>",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where even are these <i>Xians?</i> From beginning to end, there have only been ordinary people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why not take a look at the ground beneath your own feet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
