    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't we already dispose of the contaminated crops...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4119_wanqin_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, no... This is the grain that was harvested normally before. How did it become like this...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "He Sheng"
    },
